  "es": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"es\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>CV — Javier Traver | Diseño, Marketing y Publicidad</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Currículum de Javier Traver: experiencia, formación y competencias en diseño gráfico, marketing y publicidad. Descarga en PDF y versión A4.\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index,follow\"><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://sirtraver.com/cv/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://sirtraver.com/cv/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://sirtraver.com/resume/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://sirtraver.com/resume/\"><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"CV — Javier Traver | Diseño, Marketing y Publicidad\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Currículum de Javier Traver: experiencia, formación y competencias en diseño gráfico, marketing y publicidad. Descarga en PDF y versión A4.\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://sirtraver.com/cv/\"><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"profile\"><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://sirtraver.com/assets/share-sirtraver.png\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/cv.css\"></head><body><div class=\"toolbar\"><a href=\"/es/about/\">← Sobre mí</a><div class=\"toolbar-actions\"><nav class=\"cv-languages\" aria-label=\"Idioma del currículum\"><a href=\"/cv/\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\" aria-current=\"page\">ES</a><a href=\"/resume/\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\">EN</a></nav><a class=\"cv-download\" href=\"/assets/Javier_Traver_CV_ES.pdf\" download=\"Javier_Traver_CV_ES.pdf\">Descargar PDF</a><button id=\"cv-print\" type=\"button\">Imprimir</button></div></div><main class=\"page\">\n<header class=\"masthead\"><a href=\"https://sirtraver.com\" class=\"wordmark\">sirtraver</a><span class=\"document-type\">Diseño / Marketing / IA</span></header>\n<div class=\"hero\"><div><h1>Javier Traver<br>Villanueva</h1><p class=\"role\">Diseño gráfico · Marketing y Publicidad</p></div><img class=\"portrait\" src=\"/assets/cv-portrait.jpg\" alt=\"Javier Traver\"></div>\n<div class=\"contact\"><div><span class=\"city\">Madrid</span> · <a href=\"tel:+34637222637\">+34 637 222 637</a></div><a class=\"web\" href=\"https://sirtraver.com\">Portfolio: sirtraver.com</a><a href=\"mailto:javier.traver.v@me.com\">javier.traver.v@me.com</a><a class=\"linkedin\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/javiertravervillanueva\">linkedin.com/in/javiertravervillanueva</a></div>\n<p class=\"profile\"><strong>Diseñador gráfico freelance desde 2017, graduado en Diseño y estudiante de Marketing y Publicidad.</strong> Desarrollo identidades visuales y contenidos para marcas mediante diseño, fotografía, vídeo e IA generativa. Busco empleo o prácticas en equipos de diseño, comunicación o marketing.</p>\n<div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"main\"><section><h2>Experiencia profesional</h2><article class=\"job\"><h3>Diseñador gráfico freelance</h3><p class=\"meta\">2017–Actualidad</p><ul class=\"functions\"><li>Desarrollo de logotipos e identidades visuales para diferentes marcas, con coherencia en sus aplicaciones.</li><li>Diseño de banners, publicaciones para redes sociales, flyers, tarjetas de visita y packaging, en formatos digitales e impresos.</li><li>Fotografía de producto para catálogos y tiendas online. Edición, retoque y corrección de imágenes para unificar el estilo visual.</li><li>Creación y edición de contenidos audiovisuales para proyectos de comunicación.</li></ul></article>\n<p class=\"additional-heading\">Experiencia adicional</p><article class=\"job additional\"><h3>Profesor de tenis · Ciudad de la Raqueta</h3><p class=\"meta\">2019–Actualidad</p><p class=\"desc\">Planificación e impartición de clases individuales y grupales. Adaptación a distintas edades y niveles y seguimiento del aprendizaje.</p></article><article class=\"job additional older\"><h3>Profesor de tenis · El Tejar de Somontes</h3><p class=\"meta\">2009–2016</p></article></section>\n<section><h2>Formación</h2><article class=\"education-item\"><h3>Grado Superior en Marketing y Publicidad</h3><p>Universidad Francisco de Vitoria · <span class=\"current\">Actualmente</span></p></article><article class=\"education-item\"><h3>Grado en Diseño</h3><p>Universidad Complutense de Madrid · 2019</p></article><h3 class=\"subheading\">Formación complementaria</h3><div class=\"course\"><strong>Máster en IA para Creativos</strong><span>Founderz · 2025</span></div><div class=\"course\"><strong>Máster en IA e Innovación</strong><span>Founderz · 2025</span></div><div class=\"course\"><strong>Curso en Diseño UX</strong><span>Google Certificates · 2024</span></div></section></div>\n<aside class=\"side\"><section><h2>Herramientas</h2><p class=\"legend\">Autoevaluación: básico / medio / alto</p><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Affinity: nivel alto\"><span class=\"tool-name principal\">Affinity</span><span class=\"level-word\">Alto</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Photoshop: nivel alto\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Photoshop</span><span class=\"level-word\">Alto</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Illustrator: nivel alto\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Illustrator</span><span class=\"level-word\">Alto</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"InDesign: nivel alto\"><span class=\"tool-name\">InDesign</span><span class=\"level-word\">Alto</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Premiere: nivel alto\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Premiere</span><span class=\"level-word\">Alto</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Figma: nivel medio\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Figma</span><span class=\"level-word\">Medio</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Blender: nivel medio\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Blender</span><span class=\"level-word\">Medio</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Microsoft 365 / Office: nivel medio\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Microsoft 365 / Office</span><span class=\"level-word\">Medio</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"ChatGPT: nivel alto\"><span class=\"tool-name\">ChatGPT</span><span class=\"level-word\">Alto</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><p class=\"principal-note\">Affinity: herramienta principal.</p><p class=\"extra-tools\"><strong>También:</strong> Midjourney y Microsoft Copilot.</p></section>\n<section><h2>Competencias</h2><ul class=\"competencies\"><li>Diseño gráfico y comunicación visual</li><li>Identidad visual y branding</li><li>Diseño digital, impreso y packaging</li><li>Fotografía y retoque de producto</li><li>Edición de vídeo y motion graphics</li><li>Diseño de interfaces y UX/UI</li><li>Diseño web y modelado 3D</li><li>IA generativa aplicada al diseño</li></ul></section>\n<section><h2>Idiomas</h2><div class=\"lang-title\"><strong>Inglés</strong><span>C1 · Advanced</span></div><div class=\"cefr\" aria-label=\"Nivel de inglés C1\"><span>A1</span><span>A2</span><span>B1</span><span>B2</span><span class=\"selected\">C1</span><span>C2</span></div><p class=\"lang-note\">Escuela Oficial de Idiomas · 2021</p></section></aside></div>\n</main><script src=\"/assets/cv.js\" defer></script></body></html>",
  "en": "<!doctype html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\"><title>Resume — Javier Traver | Graphic Design, Marketing & Advertising</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Javier Traver’s resume: experience, education and skills in graphic design, marketing and advertising. Download the A4 PDF.\"><meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index,follow\"><link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://sirtraver.com/resume/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"es\" href=\"https://sirtraver.com/cv/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"en\" href=\"https://sirtraver.com/resume/\"><link rel=\"alternate\" hreflang=\"x-default\" href=\"https://sirtraver.com/resume/\"><meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Resume — Javier Traver | Graphic Design, Marketing & Advertising\"><meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Javier Traver’s resume: experience, education and skills in graphic design, marketing and advertising. Download the A4 PDF.\"><meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://sirtraver.com/resume/\"><meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"profile\"><meta property=\"og:image\" content=\"https://sirtraver.com/assets/share-sirtraver.png\"><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/assets/cv.css\"></head><body><div class=\"toolbar\"><a href=\"/about/\">← About me</a><div class=\"toolbar-actions\"><nav class=\"cv-languages\" aria-label=\"Resume language\"><a href=\"/cv/\" hreflang=\"es\" lang=\"es\">ES</a><a href=\"/resume/\" hreflang=\"en\" lang=\"en\" aria-current=\"page\">EN</a></nav><a class=\"cv-download\" href=\"/assets/Javier_Traver_Resume_EN.pdf\" download=\"Javier_Traver_Resume_EN.pdf\">Download PDF</a><button id=\"cv-print\" type=\"button\">Print</button></div></div><main class=\"page\">\n<header class=\"masthead\"><a href=\"https://sirtraver.com\" class=\"wordmark\">sirtraver</a><span class=\"document-type\">Design / Marketing / AI</span></header>\n<div class=\"hero\"><div><h1>Javier Traver<br>Villanueva</h1><p class=\"role\">Graphic Design · Marketing & Advertising</p></div><img class=\"portrait\" src=\"/assets/cv-portrait.jpg\" alt=\"Javier Traver\"></div>\n<div class=\"contact\"><div><span class=\"city\">Madrid</span> · <a href=\"tel:+34637222637\">+34 637 222 637</a></div><a class=\"web\" href=\"https://sirtraver.com\">Portfolio: sirtraver.com</a><a href=\"mailto:javier.traver.v@me.com\">javier.traver.v@me.com</a><a class=\"linkedin\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/javiertravervillanueva\">linkedin.com/in/javiertravervillanueva</a></div>\n<p class=\"profile\"><strong>Freelance graphic designer since 2017, with a degree in Design and currently studying Marketing & Advertising.</strong> I create visual identities and brand content through design, photography, video and generative AI. Seeking employment or an internship in design, communications or marketing.</p>\n<div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"main\"><section><h2>Professional experience</h2><article class=\"job\"><h3>Freelance Graphic Designer</h3><p class=\"meta\">2017–Present</p><ul class=\"functions\"><li>Development of logos and visual identities for brands, maintaining consistency across applications.</li><li>Design of banners, social media posts, flyers, business cards and packaging for digital and print formats.</li><li>Product photography for catalogues and online stores. Image editing, retouching and correction to achieve a consistent visual style.</li><li>Creation and editing of audiovisual content for communication projects.</li></ul></article>\n<p class=\"additional-heading\">Additional experience</p><article class=\"job additional\"><h3>Tennis Coach · Ciudad de la Raqueta</h3><p class=\"meta\">2019–Present</p><p class=\"desc\">Planning and delivery of individual and group lessons. Adapting sessions to different ages and abilities and monitoring progress.</p></article><article class=\"job additional older\"><h3>Tennis Coach · El Tejar de Somontes</h3><p class=\"meta\">2009–2016</p></article></section>\n<section><h2>Education</h2><article class=\"education-item\"><h3>Higher Vocational Training in Marketing & Advertising</h3><p>Universidad Francisco de Vitoria · <span class=\"current\">In progress</span></p></article><article class=\"education-item\"><h3>Bachelor’s Degree in Design</h3><p>Universidad Complutense de Madrid · 2019</p></article><h3 class=\"subheading\">Further training</h3><div class=\"course\"><strong>AI for Creatives programme</strong><span>Founderz · 2025</span></div><div class=\"course\"><strong>AI and Innovation programme</strong><span>Founderz · 2025</span></div><div class=\"course\"><strong>UX Design course</strong><span>Google Certificates · 2024</span></div></section></div>\n<aside class=\"side\"><section><h2>Tools</h2><p class=\"legend\">Self-assessed: basic / medium / high</p><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Affinity: high level\"><span class=\"tool-name principal\">Affinity</span><span class=\"level-word\">High</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Photoshop: high level\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Photoshop</span><span class=\"level-word\">High</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Illustrator: high level\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Illustrator</span><span class=\"level-word\">High</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"InDesign: high level\"><span class=\"tool-name\">InDesign</span><span class=\"level-word\">High</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Premiere: high level\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Premiere</span><span class=\"level-word\">High</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Figma: medium level\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Figma</span><span class=\"level-word\">Medium</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Blender: medium level\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Blender</span><span class=\"level-word\">Medium</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"Microsoft 365 / Office: medium level\"><span class=\"tool-name\">Microsoft 365 / Office</span><span class=\"level-word\">Medium</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i></i></span></div><div class=\"level-row\" aria-label=\"ChatGPT: high level\"><span class=\"tool-name\">ChatGPT</span><span class=\"level-word\">High</span><span class=\"track\"><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i><i class=\"on\"></i></span></div><p class=\"principal-note\">Affinity: primary design tool.</p><p class=\"extra-tools\"><strong>Also:</strong> Midjourney and Microsoft Copilot.</p></section>\n<section><h2>Skills</h2><ul class=\"competencies\"><li>Graphic design and visual communication</li><li>Visual identity and branding</li><li>Digital, print and packaging design</li><li>Product photography and retouching</li><li>Video editing and motion graphics</li><li>Interface design and UX/UI</li><li>Web design and 3D modelling</li><li>Generative AI for design</li></ul></section>\n<section><h2>Languages</h2><div class=\"lang-title\"><strong>English</strong><span>C1 · Advanced</span></div><div class=\"cefr\" aria-label=\"English level C1\"><span>A1</span><span>A2</span><span>B1</span><span>B2</span><span class=\"selected\">C1</span><span>C2</span></div><p class=\"lang-note\">Escuela Oficial de Idiomas · 2021</p></section></aside></div>\n</main><script src=\"/assets/cv.js\" defer></script></body></html>"
